WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
A buried shell. Rapid burial protects remains from destruction.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Forming a mold. Dissolution removes the shell; the completed mold is a shaped cavity.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Forming a cast. Later minerals fill the cavity; the completed cast reproduces its shape.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000 line:0 size:90% align:center
Different records. A mold is an empty impression; a cast is its later infill.
